  "physical_scale": "For rendering, irregular visible aggregate diameter is modelled at approximately 1.7–5.8 mm. Grain size and repeat length are assumptions, since individual grains cannot be independently measured to millimetres in these two photos.",
  "production": "All three albedo tiles are authored mathematically from deterministic seeds. Periodic coarse fields and edge-crossing pebbles tile on both axes. No source photograph pixels are used. The dark-grey boundary finish is limited to street gates and piers.",
